      "side": 1,
      "message": "From [3054802](https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Virtualization/+/3054802/comment/a68b9572_b9cc665a/):\n\u003e Jiyong Park: You are passing a mutable reference to the slice. Consider wrapping the slice with RefCell and using borrow_mut to get a mutable reference to the slice.\n\n... and use borrow in the commit function above. Be sure to check the error condition.",
